  "description": "The new Alpha model is the latest addition to ALAN’s prestigious line of handcrafted framesets, entirely made in Italy. It is the ultimate choice for cyclists who refuse to settle for standard, off-the-shelf products, seeking instead an exclusive and distinctive masterpiece characterized by classic-yet-modern lines that never go out of style. Every Alpha frame is a unique piece of art, offering full customization of geometry, finishes, and technical details—tailor-made to fit your exact needs\n\nThe Alpha frameset is a blank canvas ready to be shaped around your riding style. Its extraordinary versatility makes it the perfect foundation for either Road or Allroad/Gravel configurations.\n\nThis is a bicycle designed to adapt entirely to the rider and their way of pedaling, whatever road they choose to take.\n\nAttention to detail is in our DNA. The new Alpha is entirely built by hand through a meticulous tube-to-tube welding process.\n\nErgal 7075 Aluminum Alloy Tubing: Handpicked to ensure superior structural solidity and exceptional fatigue resistance.\n\nComfort & Control: The frame delivers controlled elasticity which, paired perfectly with the carbon fork, boasts a natural ability to absorb road vibrations\n\nDrivetrains: Fully compatible with both 1x (single chainring) and 2x (double chainring) groupsets.\n\nTire Clearance: Accommodates tires up to 40 mm, allowing you to transition seamlessly from smooth asphalt to rugged trails without compromise.",
